WEBVTT

00:00:07.216 --> 00:00:08.106
Raining?

00:00:13.297 --> 00:00:14.195
And here is...

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:27.070
From today onwards...

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.178
You are my pet.

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:33.142
Eh?

00:01:34.691 --> 00:01:40.403
(Episode 1 Shakehand)

00:01:44.588 --> 00:01:45.963
What is wrong with me?

00:01:47.918 --> 00:01:48.966
My memory...

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:51.219
I'm cold too.

00:01:52.185 --> 00:01:53.189
So cold.

00:01:54.222 --> 00:01:54.893
Right.

00:01:55.277 --> 00:01:57.808
- I'm bringing it home now.
- Did I... faint by the roadside?

00:01:57.935 --> 00:01:58.602
So...

00:02:00.031 --> 00:02:02.939
This is Inukai, right?

00:02:03.332 --> 00:02:07.611
Why is my classmate holding me?

00:02:10.618 --> 00:02:13.783
Did Inukai save me?

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:18.455
By the way, this is so close.

00:02:19.215 --> 00:02:20.164
I can see...

00:02:34.227 --> 00:02:35.504
Wait for me.

00:02:54.628 --> 00:02:58.563
Is this Inukai's home?

00:02:59.293 --> 00:03:01.018
Did she save me?

00:03:02.277 --> 00:03:05.586
Ah, I should thank her. But... eh?

00:03:06.735 --> 00:03:07.920
I can't make a sound.

00:03:08.683 --> 00:03:11.425
My body is freezing. I can't move at all.

00:03:14.484 --> 00:03:16.066
So, let's go.

00:03:16.918 --> 00:03:19.515
She has such a gentle smile
when she's at home.

00:03:20.306 --> 00:03:22.436
She has a straight face at school.

00:03:23.209 --> 00:03:24.437
Karen.

00:03:24.893 --> 00:03:25.408
Eh?

00:03:26.048 --> 00:03:27.983
The water is heated up.

00:03:28.551 --> 00:03:30.860
It's cold outside, isn't it? Hurry up.

00:03:33.973 --> 00:03:34.823
Ah.

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:38.784
Is this puppy that you found just now?

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:40.162
Mum.

00:03:40.252 --> 00:03:41.812
Huh? This lady...

00:03:41.812 --> 00:03:43.158
- is Inukai's mother?
- I know you like it,

00:03:43.551 --> 00:03:44.277
- I have to say hi.
- then you have to be responsible

00:03:44.358 --> 00:03:45.082
- I have to say hi.
- and take care of it.

00:03:45.193 --> 00:03:46.822
- But, I'm freezing.
- I will.

00:03:46.823 --> 00:03:49.143
- I'm feeling drowsy.
- I'll bring it to shower with me.

00:03:49.445 --> 00:03:50.527
- So... cold...
- I'm going to make dinner

00:03:50.608 --> 00:03:51.689
- So... cold...
- while you shower.

00:03:51.727 --> 00:03:54.842
- So, Inukai rescued a puppy.
- Come and have your dinner later.

00:03:55.335 --> 00:03:57.134
Don't take a bath
for too long just because

00:03:57.215 --> 00:03:59.014
you're excited. You might feel dizzy.

00:03:59.346 --> 00:04:01.474
- Get to bath together...
- Huh? That's impossible.

00:04:01.871 --> 00:04:03.185
I'm so jealous.

00:04:13.306 --> 00:04:14.620
Eh?

00:04:25.086 --> 00:04:25.684
Eh?

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:32.798
Eh?

00:04:34.555 --> 00:04:36.175
What are you doing, Inukai?

00:04:36.509 --> 00:04:38.512
I'm right in front of you!

00:04:39.795 --> 00:04:43.057
I shouldn't peek!

00:04:43.423 --> 00:04:44.935
I'm a pervert if I look at her!

00:04:48.678 --> 00:04:50.189
I will never do that!

00:04:50.531 --> 00:04:52.401
I'm a decent man!

00:04:53.009 --> 00:04:54.528
Close my eyes. Please!

00:04:55.045 --> 00:04:55.903
Close my eyes!

00:04:56.593 --> 00:04:58.406
Why can't I close my eyes?

00:04:58.875 --> 00:05:00.242
Hurry up! Close my eyes!

00:05:02.329 --> 00:05:04.913
Alright, stop moving.

00:05:05.093 --> 00:05:08.290
Eh? Did Inukai pick me up again?

00:05:15.415 --> 00:05:16.966
Why is Inukai

00:05:17.716 --> 00:05:19.427
in the bathroom with me...

00:05:33.858 --> 00:05:37.319
What! I... became a dog!

00:05:38.269 --> 00:05:40.519
Wait. Before that...

00:05:40.761 --> 00:05:42.742
How is it? Is it comfortable?

00:05:43.173 --> 00:05:45.543
She touches my body, my tail...

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:49.687
Wait. I... I have a tail!

00:05:54.625 --> 00:05:55.983
Hey!

00:05:56.137 --> 00:05:58.507
Don't do that with your tail.

00:06:01.307 --> 00:06:02.721
Finally, I make a sound.

00:06:03.422 --> 00:06:05.098
Is it because my body is warming up?

00:06:07.271 --> 00:06:08.894
Weird. I can't talk.

00:06:09.788 --> 00:06:11.271
Please wait for a moment.

00:06:13.603 --> 00:06:14.815
Not this.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.569
Inukai, I...

00:06:21.007 --> 00:06:23.288
No. I shouldn't peek at her!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.151
I... I can see everything.

00:07:10.367 --> 00:07:11.747
No. I'm not peeking.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:14.416
I won't peek.

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:15.961
I...

00:07:16.766 --> 00:07:17.795
I am...

00:07:37.346 --> 00:07:40.492
I will never peek!

00:07:46.319 --> 00:07:48.742
Come, let me see your face.

00:07:55.805 --> 00:07:56.500
I can't...

00:07:57.209 --> 00:07:58.377
Take my eyes off it.

00:07:59.812 --> 00:08:02.382
So cute.

00:08:03.944 --> 00:08:05.634
The puppy is so cute!

00:08:06.038 --> 00:08:07.220
Doggy is so cute!

00:08:07.413 --> 00:08:10.223
Puppy is cute, doggy is cute!

00:08:11.194 --> 00:08:12.225
The puppy is cute!

00:08:12.769 --> 00:08:16.103
Doggy is adorable!

00:08:17.891 --> 00:08:20.274
- Woof!
- Wait, Inukai.

00:08:20.406 --> 00:08:23.334
Woof.

00:08:23.386 --> 00:08:25.154
Wait a minute, Inukai.

00:08:35.302 --> 00:08:36.666
What happened?

00:08:37.782 --> 00:08:38.626
What is going on?

00:08:39.663 --> 00:08:42.755
Karen, the dinner is ready.

00:08:47.188 --> 00:08:47.818
Well.

00:08:48.594 --> 00:08:49.386
Let's go out.

00:08:56.094 --> 00:08:57.283
I'm full.

00:08:59.311 --> 00:09:01.524
The smell of lavender.

00:09:02.038 --> 00:09:02.984
By the way,

00:09:03.428 --> 00:09:05.403
I wonder if it knows any trick.

00:09:06.226 --> 00:09:07.489
A puppy doesn't know any tricks.

00:09:07.789 --> 00:09:11.408
Come on. You're being so distant.

00:09:30.682 --> 00:09:31.513
Sit.

00:09:34.938 --> 00:09:36.100
Inukai?

00:09:36.701 --> 00:09:39.979
You just said
a puppy didn't know any tricks.

00:09:42.933 --> 00:09:44.317
No, no way.

00:09:44.821 --> 00:09:47.570
If I do listen to her and sit down,

00:09:47.712 --> 00:09:49.341
then I'll really become a dog.

00:10:07.683 --> 00:10:08.633
Well, then...

00:10:12.889 --> 00:10:13.638
Hand.

00:10:19.817 --> 00:10:23.313
Inukai's hand, which I could never touch,

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.316
when I was a human...

00:10:38.179 --> 00:10:39.822
This is awesome!

00:10:40.682 --> 00:10:42.498
I never got a chance to hold Inukai's hand
when I was a human.

00:10:43.434 --> 00:10:45.153
Now that I'm a dog,

00:10:46.198 --> 00:10:49.422
finally, I can hold her hand.

00:10:54.988 --> 00:10:57.708
From today, your name will be Pochita.
